sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Navigateur
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant A as auth-service
    participant U as user-service

    B->>GW: POST /api/auth/login
    GW->>A: POST /auth/login
    A->>U: GET /users/email/xxx
    U-->>A: User (email, hash, role)
    A-->>GW: JWT Token
    GW-->>B: JWT Token

    B->>GW: GET /api/properties (+ JWT)
    GW->>GW: Validation JWT
    GW->>GW: Ajout headers X-User-Email, X-User-Role
    GW->>PROP: GET /properties
    PROP-->>GW: Liste des logements
    GW-->>B: Liste des logements
